  "verdict": "void",
  "section": "106",
  "quote": "A landlord shall apply a rent deposit that a tenant has paid to the landlord or to a former landlord in payment of the rent for the last rent period before the tenancy terminates.",
  "reason": "Section 106(10) requires the landlord to apply the rent deposit toward the rent for the last rent period before the tenancy terminates. Applying the rent deposit to unpaid utility bills and cleaning costs instead is inconsistent with this requirement and is therefore void under section 4(1)."
}

